     "gloss_en": "מיתיבי, RSBG: one may roll an egg on a hot roof, and not on hot lime. בשלמא for the one who says 'lest he insulate in ash' -- there is nothing to decree; but for the one who says 'he displaces earth' -- let him decree!",
